{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:657","content":{"id":657,"title":"多边形","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<polygon>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以绘制任意形状的多边形，我们只需要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"points","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定多边形的顶点坐标（最后不需要指定起点坐标，会自动闭合）"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<svg width=\"170\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 170 100\">\n  <polygon points=\"50 20, 150 20, 120 70, 20 70\" fill=\"#69a794\" />\n</svg>","language":"html","uuid":"0e5362a1-79c5-4adf-8c48-0676e917c17b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<svg width=\"170\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 170 100\">\n  <polygon points=\"50 20, 150 20, 120 70, 20 70\" fill=\"#69a794\" />\n</svg>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有时候我们会定义出的形状会形成多个区域，这个时候的难题就是哪些区域应该填充，那么不填充，这个由填充规则 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fill-rule","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 确定，有两种填充方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"nonzero","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：从某区域任意引出一条线，该线会与若干条线相交，如果两条线之间的夹角（两条线是有方向的）小于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"90°","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则就减 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果最终的值不为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（初始值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），那么就填充该区域，否则不填充（该种方法也称为非零环绕原则）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"evenodd","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：与上面相似，也是引出一条线，该线与若干条线相交，统计相交的次数，如果次数为奇数，那么就填充，否则不填充"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"SVG","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本概念","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本形状","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:652","type":"doc","id":652}},{"label":"多边形","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:657","type":"doc","id":657}}],"prevPage":{"title":"圆和椭圆","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:656","type":"doc","id":656}},"nextPage":{"title":"路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:668","type":"doc","id":668}},"createTime":1703605489608,"updateTime":1743303640565,"projectId":45},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640565},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.4","minAppVersion":"0.59.0","apiVersion":1,"platform":"desktop","format":"cjs","main":"main.js","editor":true,"categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"integrity":{"main.js":"eafe74429244b57e1dce6a889e1e925f0cf178f5942afe95485f081a8fa048bf","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8"},"styles":"main.css"},"entry":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/main.js","styles":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../../styles/55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654.css","integrity":"55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654"}]}